{% schema %}
  {
    
    "name": "Section 2",
    "tag": "section",
    "class": "gps-632339855946351589 gps gpsil",
    "settings": [{"type":"paragraph","content":"Section design by GemPages. [Click here to start design](https://admin.shopify.com/store/photobrickusa/apps/gempages-cro/app/shopify/edit?pageType=GP_ARTICLE&editorId=632339855845622757&sectionId=632339855946351589)"},{"type":"select","label":"Section Preload","id":"section_preload","options":[{"label":"On","value":"true"},{"label":"Off","value":"false"},{"label":"Off Lazy Script","value":"off_lazy_script"}],"default":"false"},{"type":"text","label":"Checksum","id":"checksum"},{"type":"html","id":"ggDY8Y4ErEL_text","label":"ggDY8Y4ErEL_text","default":"<p>What truly sets this machine apart, however, is its ability to transform a daily necessity into a genuine pleasure. Gone are the days of settling for subpar brews or enduring lengthy wait times. The GEM Cafe's intuitive interface and preprogrammed settings make crafting the perfect cup an effortless endeavor, whether you're a caffeine-fueled professional or a leisurely weekend sipper. This appliance has become an indispensable part of my morning routine, elevating a simple task into a cherished ritual that I look forward to each day.<br><br>With its exceptional quality, customizable features, and space-saving design, the GEM Cafe is poised to be a game-changing addition to any coffee lover's kitchen. Its proven track record of excellence and overwhelmingly positive user feedback make it a wise investment that will continue to deliver exceptional results for years to come.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","label":"ggpG-u0Nqvd_text","default":"How to Choose the Perfect Christmas Photo"},{"type":"html","id":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","label":"ggEpU9i2_s9_text","default":"<p>Choosing the right photo is one of the most important steps in creating a beautiful Memobrick. For the best results, use a clear, high-quality image with good lighting and visible faces.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Close-up portraits work beautifully for smaller sizes, while larger Memobricks are ideal for family gatherings, travel memories, or photos with detailed backgrounds.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>When selecting your photo, think about the story behind it. The best Christmas gifts aren't necessarily based on the most perfect picture—they're based on the memories that make people smile every time they see it.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","label":"ggHlOCE0sSP_text","default":"Holiday Planning Checklist"},{"type":"html","id":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","label":"ggC2dUafp4Y_text","default":"<p>Before the Christmas rush begins, take a few minutes to prepare:</p><ul><li>Choose the person you want to surprise.</li><li>Pick a meaningful photo they'll instantly recognise.</li><li>Select the Memobrick size that best suits your image.</li><li>Order early to allow plenty of time for production and delivery.</li><li>Wrap your gift and enjoy a stress-free Christmas knowing it's ready to make someone's day extra special.</li></ul>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","label":"ggqgOfLrT5l_text","default":"<p><i>Christmas is one of the few times each year when we pause to celebrate the people who matter most. Instead of rushing to buy ordinary gifts at the last minute, planning ahead gives you the opportunity to choose something truly meaningful. A personalized Memobrick transforms a cherished photo into a creative experience and a lasting keepsake that will continue to bring smiles long after the holiday season has passed.</i></p><p><i>This Christmas, don't wait until December. Start planning today, preserve your favourite memories, and give a gift that's as unique as the people receiving it.</i></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","label":"ggSIFSmb5qj_text","default":"Reviews from Happy Customers"},{"type":"html","id":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","label":"ggYtRXjDI8D_text","default":"<p>So easy to understand and a nice relaxing project for my free time. Can't wait to do another one!</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","label":"ggKXSFfWFbl_text","default":"<p>-Aaryn C.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","label":"ggaCii03Ne4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","label":"ggkn9YigrVF_text","default":"<p>\"I love these memo bricks! I ordered a smaller size, but when they emailed the mockup they showed me the difference of what it would look like compared to the bigger size. I was offered to upgrade\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggymABV5hia_text","label":"ggymABV5hia_text","default":"<p>-Kelsey M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","label":"ggN3UdyYrm4_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","label":"gg0V4YtCsoB_text","default":"<p>&nbsp;\"I split the photo in half so I could get 2 of the 60x20 so I could fill my wall more and its turned out AMAZING!\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","label":"gg5kkV4D4v9_text","default":"<p>-Candice L.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","label":"ggGMFheTViq_childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","label":"ggnO3VYmVUW_text","default":"<p>\"Excellent customer service! The design team did an excellent job and we are so pleased to have a precious family picture transformed into such a cool art form.\"</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","label":"gg20jQGtbrE_text","default":"<p>-Aaron M.</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","label":"ggVF_j4u8Y__childItem_0","default":"<p>Verified Customer</p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggeCJTAXJN8_label","label":"ggeCJTAXJN8_label","default":"<p>CHECK AVAILABILITY</p>"}],
